WEBVTT

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:32.470
to ensure that the entire process 
happens on its set configuration.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.280
So the day finally arrived, 
September 24th, 2014.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:43.460
During the process, there came a time
when the Orbiter went behind Mars,

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:47.030
and we couldn’t receive
any signal on Earth.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:53.210
We all looked at our computer
screens with hope.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:58.220
Then finally at 8:00 IST 
that moment arrived.

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:02.370
The Orbiter had placed
itself in Mars’s orbit.